Inter-Regular.ttf, Inter-Medium.ttf, Inter-SemiBold.ttf: Inter 4.1, Copyright 2016 The Inter
Project Authors (https://github.com/rsms/inter), SIL Open Font License 1.1
(https://openfontlicense.org), from Fedora's rsms-inter-fonts package, modified: the 22 characters
the emoji font also draws (U+203C, 2049, 2122, 2194-2199, 21A9, 21AA, 23CF, 24C2, 25AA, 25B6,
25C0, 2600, 2665, 26A0, 2764, 2B06, 2B1C) are removed, so a heart in a message is the colour
emoji and not Inter's outline. Made with fontTools' subsetter: every other character, all layout
features and names kept.

Compiled into every build as the app's face: a system face may be one variable font, which the
text shaper does not embolden, and its weights then all draw alike.
